  "text": "Ranged Nex (BoLG)\n\n​\nIntroduction\nWhen Nex spawns for the first time in an instance she will be praying  for the majority of the kill, making Ranged the meta for fast consistent kills. After every kill you will teleport out of the instance and re-enter in order to force Nex to always be praying .\n​\nNote: It is strongly advised to complete the Ritual of the Mahjarrat quest in order to get access to the Stone of Jas  boost, which gives a +5% damage boost in GWD1 (including Nex). This can be done via Fairy ring code D.K.Q.\n​\nPresets and Relics\n⬥ Ranged Nex (BoLG) \n\n should be combo'd with either  or \n is not recommended with  here as it can proc on the Umbra phase transition and null the  hit.\nDue to this,   is recommended instead.\nRotation\nPre-Fight\nUse \n(6.0s)   →  → \nSmoke Phase\n(tc) +  + 7 hit  →  \nFumus\n +  →  +  →  \nShadow Phase\n →  →  if not phased\nUmbra\n + \nBlood Phase\n\nCruor\n +  →   → \nIce Phase\n  → \nGlacies\n + \nZaros Phase\n →   →   →  →  → \n​\nPositioning\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n⬥ Movement for most of the phases can be seen in the example kill linked below, the only transition where different positioning yields better results is Blood → Ice.\n\nBlood → Ice\n⬥ Example\nAlternate Blood → Ice\n⬥ Example\nPerfect Blood → Ice\n⬥ Example\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n​\nExample Kills\n⬥ Kill Example \n\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "Ranged Nex (BoLG) ​ Introduction When Nex spawns for the first time in an instance she will be praying for the majority of the kill, making Ranged the meta for fast consistent kills. After every kill you will teleport out of the instance and re-enter in order to force Nex to always be praying . ​ Note: It is strongly advised to complete the Ritual of the Mahjarrat quest in order to get access to the Stone of Jas boost, which gives a +5% damage boost in GWD1 (including Nex). This can be done via Fairy ring code D.K.Q. ​ Presets and Relics ⬥ Ranged Nex (BoLG) should be combo'd with either or is not recommended with here as it can proc on the Umbra phase transition and null the hit. Due to this, is recommended instead. Rotation Pre-Fight Use (6.0s) → → Smoke Phase (tc) + + 7 hit → Fumus + → + → Shadow Phase → → if not phased Umbra + Blood Phase Cruor + → → Ice Phase → Glacies + Zaros Phase → → → → → ​ Positioning ⬥ Movement for most of the phases can be seen in the example kill linked below, the only transition where different positioning yields better results is Blood → Ice. Blood → Ice ⬥ Example Alternate Blood → Ice ⬥ Example Perfect Blood → Ice ⬥ Example ​ Example Kills ⬥ Kill Example",
